{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/utilitywindow\/dialogsuppressiontoggle(_:issuppressed:)-2p7fh"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Enables user suppression of an alert with a custom suppression","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"message."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dialogSuppressionToggle","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"title","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isSuppressed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Binding","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI7BindingV","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Binding"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StringProtocol","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sy"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The title of the suppression toggle in the dialog. This"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter can be elided to use the default suppression title."}]}],"name":"title"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the suppression toggle is on or off in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dialog."}]}],"name":"isSuppressed"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Applying dialog suppression adds a toggle to dialogs on Windows,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which allows the user to request the alert not be displayed again."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Typically whether a dialog is suppressed is stored in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStorage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and used to decide whether to present the dialog in the future."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example configures an alert with a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"suppression toggle. The toggle’s state is stored in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStorage"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"used to determine whether or not to show the dialog when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“Delete Items” button is pressed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct MyApp: App {","    @State private var isShowingDialog = false","    @AppStorage(\"suppressEraseItemAlert\")","    private var suppressAlert = false","","    var body: some Scene {","        Window(...) {","            Button(\"Delete items\") {","                isShowingDialog = true","            }","        }","","        AlertScene(","            \"Are you sure you want to erase these items?\",","            isPresented: $isShowingDialog","        ) {","            Button(\"Erase\", role: .destructive) {","                \/\/ Handle item deletion.","            }","            Button(\"Cancel\", role: .cancel) {","                \/\/ Handle cancellation","            }","        }","        .dialogSuppressionToggle(","            \"Do not ask about erasing items again\",","            isSuppressed: $suppressAlert)","    }","}"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"title":"dialogSuppressionToggle(_:isSuppressed:)","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE23dialogSuppressionToggle_12isSuppressedQrqd___AA7BindingVySbGtSyRd__lF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI13UtilityWindowV","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dialogSuppressionToggle"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"text":"S","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"S","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"isSuppressed","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"Binding","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI7BindingV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow\/dialogSuppressionToggle(_:isSuppressed:)-2p7fh"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Binding":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A property wrapper type that can read and write a value owned by a source of"},{"type":"text","text":"